---
title: A sprint, its axis named in Mermaid's own format
---
gantt
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %d.%m
  tickInterval 1week
  weekday monday
  excludes weekends
  section Plan
  Sketch :done, s1, 2026-01-05, 4d
  Review :active, r1, after s1, 3d
  section Build
  Core :crit, c1, after r1, 8d
  Code freeze :vert, f1, after c1, 0d
  Ship :milestone, m1, after c1, 0d
